Lekmap v5.3 — changes since v5.2
================================

This file is the release changelog for the map script: what actually changed
from v5.2 to v5.3. Add new bullets here only when a change is finished (not
WIP notes). Over time it should read as one coherent v5.3 story.


Fractal / plot pipeline (LekmapPangaeaFractalv5.2.lua)
-----------------------------------------------------
- Fixed plotTypes indexing: terrain and downstream passes that write
  self.plotTypes now use 1-based indices (y*iW+x+1), matching
  4_HBMapGenerator.SetPlotTypes, which indexes the Lua table with i+1 per plot.
  v5.2 mixed 0-based fractal writes with 1-based consumers, which shifted
  coast/land relative to islands and broke wedge alignment.
- Inland sea rounding: after rounding/enlarging, the tile list used for inland
  sea “spray” is rebuilt from the full connected component so every tile in the
  region is eligible, not only tiles touched in the last rounding iteration.


Island orchestration (3_PangaeaIslands.lua)
-------------------------------------------
- Island layer continues to edit the same plotTypes table before SetPlotTypes;
  placement order unchanged in spirit (special branches first, then drafted
  types via tryOneSpot where applicable).
- Increased max tryOneSpot attempts for drafted island placement so rare picks
  that depend on random ocean seeds get more rolls.
- Rare roster: some types removed from active draft (commented includes + table
  entries, parked at bottom of rare lists) while tuning; odds/params adjusted on
  types still in rotation.
- River delta disabled from draft (commented include, table entry, placement
  branch) alongside other paused rares.
- Per-island `budget` values retargeted to ≈ (expected flat+hills tiles +
  0.5×mountain tiles) / 12, using script header / footprint estimates.


Island scripts (general)
------------------------
- Aligned island scripts that read/write plotTypes to 1-based indexing
  (y*iW+x+1) where they touch the shared table, consistent with the fractal
  fix above.
- Individual island geometry and behavior tweaks are not listed here; see git
  history per XX_island_*.lua. Broad areas touched include river delta
  experiments (when enabled: outer-ocean check, coast-centered wedge, E/W
  coast filter), crescent rename and experiments, jungle peak anchors / NW hooks,
  broken heart / edge-of-world / ellipse work then removal from draft, and
  assorted common/uncommon/rare fixes where plot indexing mattered.


Starting plots / NW layer (4a_HBAssignStartingPlots.lua)
--------------------------------------------------------
- Adjustments where island targets interact with starts or natural wonders
  (e.g. jungle peak), as needed for the island changes above.


Repo / docs
-----------
- Removed standalone markdown specs (`MAP_GENERATION_SEQUENCE.md`,
  `XX_island_rare_PolarMerge_SPEC_SEQUENCE.md`, `docs/DRAGON_SHAPE_HANDOFF.md`);
  pipeline and shape intent remain in script comments + this changelog.


Maintenance note
